<template><heading>Controller</heading><section data-lp5-kind="explanation">Event dispatch is a kind of hierarchical state machine, implemented with a stack where push is a "call" and pop is a "return".</section><section data-lp5-kind="code"><name>Outermost scope objects</name><code><![CDATA[let handlerStack = new Array(); // top of stack is current event handler

function baseEventHandler(event){
   let handler;
   for(let handler; (handler = handlerStack.at(-1)) !== undefined; ){
       let result = handler.dispatch.next(event);
       if(result.done)
           handlerStack.pop()
       else if(result.value === handler) // keep same handler
           break;
       else
           handlerStack.push(result.value);
       }
}]]></code></section></template>